{"t":"Costello/Transcripts","s":"costello-transcripts-dc9ad","k":"outro","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCostello: Welcome, <i>Player</i>! Feel free to tell me what brings you here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nCostello: My name is Costello.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nCostello: I'm the abbot of the White Raven Monastery on the {Isle} of the Kings.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>isle/order</b><br/>\nCostello: We founded our monastery to guard the royal tombs and to gather {wisdom} and knowledge.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>wisdom</b><br/>\nCostello: You may enter the library upstairs. Don't go any further upstairs, though, as this area is reserved for members of our order.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nCostello: The deceased leaders of the Thaian empire rest beneath this monastery in tombs and {crypts}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>caves</b><br/>\nCostello: {Anselm}, the first monk of our {order}, discovered them while looking for a suitable burial place for his {king}.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>anselm</b><br/>\nCostello: He was a humble and pious man, and he was chosen by the royal family of Thais to find a resting place for their dead.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nCostello: Good bye, <i>Player</i>!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a></span>\n<p><b>If you have committed a crime by trespassing on the floors above the library (the absolution payment he will demand from you depends on your level):</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCostello: WHAT? You have to be that trespasser my brothers told me about! Entering the restricted area is a horrible crime!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>anything but <i>crime</i> or <i>absolution</i></b><br/>\nCostello: Be gone!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a></span>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCostello: WHAT? You have to be that trespasser my brothers told me about! Entering the restricted area is a horrible crime!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>crime/absolution</b><br/>\nCostello: The only way to redeem such an offence is the sacrifice of 500/1.000/5.000/10.000 gold pieces! Are you willing to pay that sum?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>anything but <i>yes</i></b><br/>\nCostello: Then be gone!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a></span>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nCostello: WHAT? You have to be that trespasser my brothers told me about! Entering the restricted area is a horrible crime!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>crime/absolution</b><br/>\nCostello: The only way to redeem such an offence is the sacrifice of 500/1.000/5.000/10.000 gold pieces! Are you willing to pay that sum?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nCostello: So receive your absolution! And never do such a thing again!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nCostello: Good bye, <i>Player</i>!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><span><a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a></span></div></div></div></div></div>","quests":[]}